  tensor of rank `k+1` with dimensions `[I, J, K, ..., M, N]` where:

    * `output[i, j, k, ..., m, n] = diagonal[i, j, k, ..., n]` for `m == n`.
    * `output[i, j, k, ..., m, n] = input[i, j, k, ..., m, n]` for `m != n`.

